<title>UK: LME copper extends gains, nickel, zinc at new high.</title>
<headline>LME copper extends gains, nickel, zinc at new high.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Extends gains, moves above $2,220 as Comex opens firmer and after spreads widen. Cash/threes $20 wider at $190/$200 backwardation.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Touches fresh 4-1/2 month high around $7,800, just under $7,820 target.</p>
<p>ZINC - Hits fresh two-year high above $1,180.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Pushes above $1,625, follows copper.</p>
</text>
